name shdoc
category Package
revision 41991
shortdesc Float environment to document the shell commands of a terminal session
longdesc The package provides a simple, though fancy float environment
longdesc to document terminal sessions -- like command executions or
longdesc shell operations. The look and feel of the package output
longdesc imitates the look of a shell prompt.
